[{"client_msg_id":"27644344-bc80-43fe-95b3-08b390c7d55e","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"やったぜ！来年くらいに頼む\n\u003chttps://nazology.net/archives/85043\u003e","ts":"1615968114.023200","attachments":[{"fallback":"ナゾロジー: あらゆるアレルギーや自己免疫疾患を抑えるタンパク質を発見 - ナゾロジー","id":1,"title":"あらゆるアレルギーや自己免疫疾患を抑えるタンパク質を発見 - ナゾロジー","title_link":"https://nazology.net/archives/85043","text":"あらゆるアレルギーや自己免疫疾患を抑えるタンパク質「ニューリチン」 免疫はわたしたちの体を守る重要な仕組みですが、時に誤作動を起こし「ポンコツ化」します。","image_url":"https://nazology.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/396ffddca3d3c83ab092d5aef9fc7619.png","fields":[{"title":"Written by","value":"川勝康弘","short":true},{"title":"Est. reading time","value":"0 minutes","short":true}],"blocks":null,"ts":1615968021,"service_name":"ナゾロジー","service_icon":"https://nazology.net/wp-content/themes/nazology/img/icon/apple-icon-57x57.png","from_url":"https://nazology.net/archives/85043","original_url":"https://nazology.net/archives/85043"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gV7z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AD3F8716-86E2-4BE3-BBCC-BC5753FF60C6","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"学生の時は慢性鼻炎でしたけど、二十歳くらいに体質が変わったのか自然と治りました。運が良い方だったのかなー。","ts":"1615959411.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"urayamashi","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5W6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3829ADF2-3DAF-423F-B0A6-220CBBA238B6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そういえば、左の鼻の骨が歪んでいるらしくて、初見の耳鼻科に行くと必ず手術しないと根本的には鼻詰まりは治らないよと言われるけど、手術が嫌で30年経ってしまった。","ts":"1615952034.020900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nyHN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"626300CD-2A3A-495D-99A1-833EC6AB7166","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003c#C016J5KFARM|hobby-gadget\u003e で空気清浄機を相談しましょう！","ts":"1615951887.018700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"spin_keizai","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FbcvL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d0682c6-8f7a-420e-82e4-29e6446a124f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"後鼻神経切断を割とガチで考えて専門の病院にもいったけど、お前レベルはレーザーで焼いとけって暗に言われた\n\u003chttps://nose-clinic.jp/information/surgicaloperation.html\u003e","ts":"1615951089.017900","attachments":[{"fallback":"鼻のクリニック東京","id":1,"title":"鼻のクリニック東京","title_link":"https://nose-clinic.jp/information/surgicaloperation.html","text":"鼻のクリニック東京は東京都中央区にある、鼻のための手術専門施設です。慢性鼻炎・蓄膿症（副鼻腔炎）花粉症の日帰り手術治療を行っています。","blocks":null,"service_name":"nose-clinic.jp","from_url":"https://nose-clinic.jp/information/surgicaloperation.html","original_url":"https://nose-clinic.jp/information/surgicaloperation.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Lg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73bfd42c-4879-4379-ad29-8813ecefcb8a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私は冬になると乾燥してよく鼻血が出てしまいますね。加湿器と塗り薬が効きました。","ts":"1615950984.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0=2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31f0f90a-658c-4a7c-9f12-7f83fb44ef59","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"マスク便利","ts":"1615950984.016800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zxj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a731915c-08ef-4220-a079-2073a80180c2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私もそうですけど、近寄らない、症状が出始めたらすぐにマスクするをすれば結構食い止められますね","ts":"1615950972.016300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tgID"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f090f7d-464f-4db2-861c-3c42e4558af5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ハウスダスト持ちなのは分かってる(割に部屋は壊滅的)","ts":"1615950920.015000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tlne"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec05b56c-e7c7-4bda-8b28-af20191a0f78","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"季節性ならまあ多分、そうじゃないなら一応他も疑ったほうが....くらいか?","ts":"1615950912.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SAvgr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75af611c-e97f-4e4e-8e66-bd970f7fdfee","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"多分9割くらいの確率で慢性鼻炎由来だと思うw","ts":"1615950833.013600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Ym"}]},{"client_msg_id":"793c0f4b-d27d-4e7f-b95a-d667910ef880","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分はその時、自立神経の問題だったので精神科で漢方を処方されてそれでなんとか落ち着きました。\n一応そっち方面も疑ってみたほうがいいかもです","ts":"1615950742.013000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ekFw8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa58b28e-760b-4220-aae5-e5aeb0c783eb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"年とって、薄味、いつものを食べる派が長生きなの、刺激物やらをくって、うっかり新規アレルギーでアナフィラキシーしない意味なのかもしれないw","ts":"1615946209.011700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fsqev"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c095f85-a273-4e28-a9a1-cd909909cd5e","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"結構以前でなかったやつも検出されたりするって話し聞きますけど。。。増えるのやめていただきたい","ts":"1615945975.010700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AGf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c7605f3-7ff2-4304-b4d9-c10a18649388","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"かわるといっても\n• 免疫療法してるわけじゃなく薬での抑制治療とはいえ、薬なしでもだいぶ症状が弱くなってきた実感がある\n• あらたに増えたかもしれない(自覚はない)\nなので、極端に変動というわけじゃないですけどねw","ts":"1615945473.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MZVC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"824cfc6c-ea87-4bf8-901d-5288d3a38c91","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"変化するっていうのも恐ろしい・・・私もやったのは５年前だからなー","ts":"1615945180.007700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H14"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f9e3737-a54e-4b62-ad98-25c57738bb9f","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ですね。とりあえず、飛散の季節になったら潔く耳鼻科に行こうって思えるようになります。","ts":"1615944516.006100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wj2Pa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3e48682-2f4b-4b93-93f9-93b2361144cb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"だいぶたったので、多少傾向かわってそう","ts":"1615944445.004300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5NyV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52befe6b-2f0a-4d47-aedb-7971f9cb8ec4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分は、スギ、ヒノキ、弱めにブタクサ、ハウスダスト、スギ系に付随して一部果物にちょっとある、かな?","ts":"1615944436.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OSlV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16dcb3e1-764f-4f1f-9f16-c2c44fc7a7a7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そうだねえ、まとめてやれるし、やったほうがいいよね","ts":"1615944401.003200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ii/AV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fe6d026-d717-4f00-b438-223ed8ed11c7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"アレルギー検査、ハウスダストとかカビとかもわかるので、1回やっておいて損はないと思います。\nちなみに僕は、スギ、ヒノキ、イネなどの自然界のやつらが全滅なので、春から秋にかけてずっと鼻炎に悩まされています。","ts":"1615944352.002700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VMAFy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa9d1d5d-dff6-4539-9d9a-c0c7b161ac50","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そろそろ花粉症の検査してもらった方がいい気がしてきた","ts":"1615941841.001000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"epZcs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c48bdad-edef-43bb-8ec4-90d9bdf1530f","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"花粉の時期よくあります、つらい \u0026gt; 鼻血","ts":"1615939810.000300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I8cy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dc6c6be-2e96-4225-bfd3-2a87edc75daa","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分も一時期ありましたね…風呂入るたびに鼻血が出て何度か倒れた記憶がある","ts":"1615932972.001400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR","U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b0=E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fba501f1-f8f9-4811-bf1e-9a028efb5346","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(風呂の中でよかったとも言う)","ts":"1615909618.000500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2MT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f66315d5-ef64-4de9-a314-01ae85e5076b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"風呂入っていたら突然鼻血出てつらい","ts":"1615909610.000300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":3,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U81LLJ340","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jxc5e"}]}]
